==Standard dialogue==
===After [[Cook's Assistant]]===
* '''Cook:''' How is the adventuring going, my friend?
* {{topt|Do you have any other quests for me?}}
** {{tcond|If the player is on a free-to-play world:}}
*** '''Cook:''' I don't have anything for you to do right now, sorry.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player is on a members' world:}}
*** {{tact|Continues in [[Transcript:Recipe for Disaster/Another Cook's Quest]]}}
* {{topt|I am getting strong and mighty.}}
** '''Player:''' I am getting strong and mighty. Grrr{{sic}}
** '''Cook:''' Glad to hear it.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I keep on dying.}}
** '''Player:''' I keep on dying.
** '''Cook:''' Ah well, at least you keep coming back to life!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Can I use your range?}}
** '''Player:''' Can I use your range?
** '''Cook:''' Go ahead - it's a very good range. It's easier to use than most other ranges.
** '''Cook:''' Its called the Cook-o-matic 100. It uses a combination of state of the art temperature regulation and magic.
** '''Player:''' Will it mean my food will burn less often?
** '''Cook:''' Well, that's what the salesman told us anyway...
** '''Player:''' Thanks?
** {{tact|end}}

===After [[Recipe for Disaster]]===
* '''Cook:''' You were seriously great when you defeated the Culinaromancer! I can't believe I nearly caused all of those people to be killed! So how is the adventuring going now?
* {{topt|Do you have any other quests for me?}}
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|I am getting strong and mighty.}}
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|I keep on dying.}}
** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|Can I use your range?}}
** {{tact|above}}

===Interacting with the [[Cooking range (Lumbridge Castle)|cooking range]] in Lumbridge Castle before finishing [[Cook's Assistant]]===
* '''Cook:''' Hey, who said you could use that?
* {{tact|end}}

==Treasure Trails==
===Beginner===
* '''Cook:''' Well done.
* You've [found a new clue scroll/obtained a casket]!
* {{tact|receives= a [new clue scroll/casket]}}
* {{tact|end}}

===Medium===
* '''Cook:''' I've always wondered how many cannons the castle has. Could you find out for me?
* {{tact|receives=a challenge scroll}}
* {{tbox|The cook has given you a challenge scroll!}}
====When talked to again====
* '''Cook:''' Please tell me how many cannons there are.
* {{tcond|When given the wrong answer:}}
** '''Cook:''' Hmm, I don't think that's right.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|When given the correct answer:}}
** '''Cook:''' Cheers!
** {{tact|receives=[another clue scroll/a casket]}}
** {{tbox|The cook has given you [another clue scroll/a casket]!}}
** {{tact|end}}